ing it an attractive option for those seeking a peaceful yet connected lifestyle. [...] Squareyards Logo\nThe Wadhwa Group developer logo\n\n# The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nThe Wadhwa Aquaria Grande is located in Borivali West, Mumbai, offering thoughtfully designed 3, 4 BHK Flats. Developed by The Wadhwa Group, the property is priced from ₹ 3.55 Cr up to ₹ 4.98 Cr. This development provides a range of 3, 4 BHK to suit different family sizes and preferences. With 17 residential units, it offers a vibrant community living experience. The location boasts a connectivity index of 4.1, ensuring easy access to key destinations. Residents can enjoy a modern lifestyle with Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Lift, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Sauna, Party Hall, Normal Park / Central Green. The project's RERA number is P51800007959.","score":0.7724109,"raw_content":null,"id":"a9bb0f-01"},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/project-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs","title":"5 Flats for Sale in Wadhwa Aquaria Grande, Mumbai - MagicBricks","content":"Wadhwa Aquaria Grande. Carpet Area. 2400 sqft. Status. Ready to Move. Premium Tower with all world class Amenities like Swimming Pool Gymnasium indoor games","score":0.7463059,"raw_content":null,"id":"9cd545-02"},{"url":"https://www.thewadhwagroup.com/residential/aquaria-grande","title":"Aquaria Grande | Luxury Apartments by Wadhwa Group","content":"Amenities that command luxury Lounge Bar & Restaurant Spa Pool/Snooker Room Squash Court Swimming Pool Gymnasium Lounge Bar & Restaurant Spa","score":0.71113056,"raw_content":null,"id":"1d799b-03"},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/wadhwa-aquaria-grande-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303239393439","title":"Wadhwa Aquaria Grande in Borivali West, Mumbai - MagicBricks","content":"Total Units 140 Project Size 2 Acre Launch Date Dec 2009 View Amenities(14)View. Living, Dining, Passage Flooring - Camelia Composite Marble with polishin